    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Borough Yards: a panel discussion and walk",
            "paragraphs": [
                "This event combines a moderated discussion with a guided walk to explore how Borough Yards is shaped through its innovative pop-up platform, locally-rooted businesses and cultural programming. Featuring a panel of independent tenants, founders and on-site contributors, the conversation will reflect on how the neighbourhood is used day to day, how culture and activity shape experience, and how the site continues to evolve through new uses and collaborations.",
                "The session will be followed by a short walking tour of Borough Yards. Along the route, speakers will point to examples of pop-ups and cultural activations, offering a closer look at how different audiences move through and engage with the area.",
                "Through this event, participants can learn more about - and experience - Borough Yards as a lifestyle destination, an active public space, and a place where there is always something new to encounter."
            ]
        }
    ],
